{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28301","headline":"奉和白相公圣德和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上三相公长句四韵 · 杜牧","name":"奉和白相公圣德和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上三相公长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行看腊破好年光，万寿南山对未央。\n黠戛可汗修职贡，文思天子复河湟。\n应须日驭西巡狩，不假星弧北射狼。\n吉甫裁诗歌盛业，一篇江汉美宣王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}